WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.270
- Britney Spears wins big in court.

00:00:02.270 --> 00:00:04.800
She wins the right to
hire her own attorney

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:07.440
who can advocate for her own rights.

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:09.690
In the most recent
conservatorship hearing,

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:13.280
the judge accepted the
resignation of her former counsel

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:14.780
and accepted the appointment

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:16.920
of her new lawyer, Matthew Rosengart,

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:20.210
who comes from a very
prestigious, very large law firm,

00:00:20.210 --> 00:00:21.300
Greenberg Traurig.

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:23.310
Now Rosengart is a former
federal prosecutor.

00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:24.740
He seems to have lots of experience

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:27.710
and I'm sure will represent
Britney Spears very, very well,

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:29.250
but it's odd that he doesn't appear

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:30.960
to have much conservatorship experience.

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:33.390
You would think that in a
high-profile conservatorship,

00:00:33.390 --> 00:00:35.170
like the one that Britney Spears is in,

00:00:35.170 --> 00:00:37.370
that she would hire
someone who specializes

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:39.580
in conservatorships to
make sure that she's able

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:41.290
to get out of this conservatorship.

00:00:41.290 --> 00:00:43.060
So we will see what happens next.

00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:45.153
And we will see all of them in court.

